{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_10128114","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"10128114","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1028106001:0":{"text":"휴윈 양의 기억의 조각을... 활성화하면, 우리도 그 기억을 보게 될 텐데... 그래도 괜찮아요?","source_cn":"伊温小姐的记忆碎片……激活后，我们也能看到你的回忆吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ECB02D41B6F2C28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028106002:0":{"text":"네, 전 괜찮아요... 마력을 흡수해볼 테니 기억의 조각을 안정적으로 유지해 주세요.","source_cn":"不，没关系的……我现在就试着吸收这片魔力，拜托你们维持...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3462156BA88A7808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028106003:0":{"text":"하지만...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0028CC28D9216E1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1028106003":{"text":"하지만...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0028CC28D9216E1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1028106004:0":{"text":"빛이 물결처럼 퍼지며 과거의 기억들이 눈앞에 펼쳐졌다...","source_cn":"水波般的光芒划过，一段过去的回忆展现在眼前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ABE31F0EF507699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028106005:0":{"text":"정말 방법이 없는 걸까? 땅거미 숲의 현자님께 부탁해서... 숲 밖에서 의사를 찾아볼게! 꼭 치료할 수 있을 거야...","source_cn":"真的没办法了吗？我、我去求薄暮丛林的贤者……去丛林之外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33A51E2A5024DF6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028106006:0":{"text":"...이 병은... 어떤 의사도 못 고친다고 했어, 아든님도 그렇게 말씀하셨는걸...","source_cn":"……我的病……那么多医生都没办法，连雅顿大人都这么说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33B10731284F32F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028106007:0":{"text":"여보, 미안해... 결혼한 지 이제 일 년도 채 되지 않았는데, 난... 약속을 못 지킬 거 같아...","source_cn":"对不起，亲爱的……我们结婚才半年，但……我可能做不到对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD12760B6AD758F81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028106008:0":{"text":"나, 나는 타란 강에서 태어난 정령인데도, 타란 강에 뿌리내린 사람들을 도와줄 힘이 없다니...","source_cn":"我、我是从塔兰河中诞生的精灵，却没法帮助世代生活在这条...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D511486342CECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028106009:0":{"text":"물은 모든 걸 달래는 힘이 있지만, 난 그 힘을 사용할 수도 없어...","source_cn":"水明明有着抚慰一切的力量，可我却无法使用这种力量……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8118449BFD3E6C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028106010:0":{"text":"왜지? 내가 나약해서 그런 걸까? 낯선 환경과 사람이 두렵고, 감정을 솔직하게 드러내는 게 두려워... 지금처럼 도움이 필요한 사람들 앞에 나서는 것조차 망설여져...","source_cn":"为什么呢？因为我的胆怯吗？我害怕陌生的环境和人，害怕坦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE5F79A021794D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1028106011:1":{"text":"나... 나는 대체 뭘 할 수 있는 거지?","source_cn":"我……我还能做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8BBABFF471B6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1028106012:0":{"text":"음? 무슨 일이죠? 휴윈 양의 기억이 갑자기 끊어졌어요!","source_cn":"诶？发生了什么？伊温小姐的回忆突然中断了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC41368E9B47B3055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1028106013:2":{"text":"크르릉!","source_cn":"吼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA90EBE31525F914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1028106013":{"text":"크르릉!","source_cn":"吼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA90EBE31525F914","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1028106014:0":{"text":"이, 이 몬스터들! 휴윈 양의 흩어진 마력에 이끌려 온 게 분명해요!","source_cn":"这些——这些魔物！它们肯定是被伊温小姐逸散的魔力吸引来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B8F01B67D03339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1028106015:2":{"text":"나쁜 놈들! 휴윈 양의 소중한 기억을 해칠 수 없어!","source_cn":"坏家伙！我绝不会让它们伤害到伊温小姐的宝贵回忆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883A3A4624CF8106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1028107001:0":{"text":"휴윈, 우리가 몬스터를 처리할 테니 걱정하지 마.","source_cn":"伊温小姐，我们会解决魔物，不要惊慌。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5568FD73B7372726","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"휴윈, 우리가 몬스터를 처리할 테니 걱정하지 마.","female":"휴윈, 우리가 몬스터를 처리할 테니 걱정하지 마.","variant_male_record_index":"110709","variant_female_record_index":"110710","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1028107002:0":{"text":"고마워요, 부탁드릴게요...","source_cn":"谢谢，拜托你们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F4B812BEC538A00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:41:10128115:0":{"text":"흩어진 휴윈의 마력에 이끌린 한 몬스터가 그녀의 힘을 흡수하려고 한다. 긴박한 상황이다.","source_cn":"有魔物被伊温流散的魔力吸引了过来，想要吞噬她的力量，情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ACB7BBF8AA6547E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"몬스터다!","source_cn":"有怪物过来了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D917FB135D7D423","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"몬스터다!","female":"몬스터다!","variant_male_record_index":"61180","variant_female_record_index":"61181","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"쉿, 이 기억을 방해하지 마","source_cn":"嘘，不要扰乱这段记忆","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3711759317D1F13D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"쉿, 이 기억을 방해하지 마","female":"쉿, 이 기억을 방해하지 마","variant_male_record_index":"61178","variant_female_record_index":"61179","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:42:10128114:0":{"text":"마력이 흩어진 곳에 화관을 놓고, 휴윈의 기억의 조각을 활성화시켰다.","source_cn":"你将花冠放到魔力散逸的地方，激活了伊温的记忆碎片。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EFDD2AE48F98794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"블랙 스크린","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:回忆中的男性":{"text":"남성","source":"回忆中的男性","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:回忆中的女性":{"text":"여성","source":"回忆中的女性","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:回忆中的伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"回忆中的伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:魔物":{"text":"마물","source":"魔物","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블